{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PUqsKlTNL61795686252.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>運輸署宣布下周一起，接受網約車車輛駕駛許可證申請。<br/></p><p>運輸署署長謝詠誼表示，署方下周一上午10時，會開放申請專頁予符合資格的駕駛者申請。申請者可經智方便申請，填妥資料及遞交身份證後，於網上繳費，每年82元，成功申請會發出電子版駕駛許可證。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CAR-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026A9UTJT5hAn1795686261.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於網約車車輛許可證，即網約車車牌，就會在明年初接受申請，名額一萬個，如果申請超出上限會抽籤決定。<br/></p><p>運輸署署長謝詠誼說：「下周一接受的是網約車駕駛許可證，駕駛許可證並無上限，全年都接受申請，並非先到先得，所以申請人不需急於下周一，第一時間提交申請。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.880438+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:13.377340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:38.324325+00:00","content_hash":"4d12a0ed820fcfae7596fcbca437f33ca6ebb171a6a1196fd7074a50ba39dd72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.880438+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}